t-raise: 0pt\">­&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 서울한강체 L\">시·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 서울한강체 L\">도</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 서울한강체 L; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 서울한강체 L; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 서울한강체 L\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 서울한강체 L; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 서울한강체 L; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 서울한강체 L\">군</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 서울한강체 L; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 서울한강체 L; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 서울한강체 L\">구</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 서울한강체 L; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 서울한강체 L; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">[</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 서울한강체 L\">통신</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 서울한강체 L; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 서울한강체 L; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 서울한강체 L\">방문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 서울한강체 L; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 서울한강체 L; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 서울한강체 L\">전화권유</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 서울한강체 L; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 서울한강체 L; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 서울한강체 L\">판매업 업무부서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 서울한강체 L; LETTER-S